    "stem": "Rohan packs more roti and sabzi than he will eat for a school picnic. At the end he tips the uneaten food into a bin. Farmers and community members grew, cooked, and carried that food from farm to plate.\n\nWhich statements correctly connect avoiding food waste with that work?",
